    "flintVersion": "1.0.0", 
    "name": "waxed_copper_door_honeycomb_and_axe_click", 
    "description": "Without sneaking, right-clicking a waxed copper door with an axe or honeycomb toggles the door instead of removing the wax or re-waxing it: the door stays waxed and the items are not used. Representative for the four waxed copper doors (waxed_copper, waxed_exposed, waxed_weathered, waxed_oxidized), which share one implementation.", 
    "tags": ["redstone", "door", "block-state", "player", "copper", "interaction", "honeycomb", "axe"], 
